{"bookId": "33642049", "title": "帕慕克别样的色彩系列：纯真博物馆", "bookmarks": {"synckey": 1678520459, "updated": [{"bookId": "33642049", "bookmarkId": "33642049_63_1789-1842", "createTime": 1678520459, "range": "1789-1842", "markText": "但另一方面，除了那些依媒妁之言结婚的人，我也听到过很多彼此看见后结识，随后结婚的人说“我们是目成心许的。”", "colorStyle": 0, "type": 1, "chapterUid": 63}, {"bookId": "33642049", "bookmarkId": "33642049_21_3243-3321", "createTime": 1676475416, "range": "3243-3321", "markText": "从二十岁开始，我觉得自己身上有一个可以保护我免受各种灾难和不幸的无形盔甲。这种感觉还告诉我，过分关心他人的不幸也可能让我不幸，另外还可能导致我的盔甲被刺穿。", "type": 1, "chapterUid": 21}, {"bookId": "33642049", "bookmarkId": "33642049_20_4743-4865", "createTime": 1676130574, "range": "4743-4865", "markText": "一个新近从美国回来开了诊所的“心理医生”，一认识就给了我他新印的名片，在一个中年女人的一再追问下，他对聚拢在自己周围的人群描述了爱情的定义：一个人尽管有别的机会，但拒绝这些机会只想不断地和同一个人做爱，那么这种让人感觉幸福的情感就叫做“爱情”。", "type": 1, "chapterUid": 20}, {"bookId": "33642049", "bookmarkId": "33642049_19_4312-4390", "createTime": 1676129919, "range": "4312-4390", "markText": "也许一些人在某些欣喜若狂的时刻能够真诚地想到或者说，“此刻”他们正在经历一生中那个金色的时刻，但是他们依然会相信，他们将在以后经历比这还要美好和幸福的时刻。", "type": 1, "chapterUid": 19}, {"bookId": "33642049", "bookmarkId": "33642049_14_6111-6232", "createTime": 1676115493, "range": "6111-6232", "markText": "我太幸福了。但这不是一种用脑子来衡量、理解的幸福，是我的肌肤体验着认识到的一种幸福，也是后来在日常生活中，打电话时在我的后脑勺里，急速爬楼梯时在我的尾骨里，抑或是和四周后准备订婚的茜贝尔在塔克希姆的一家餐厅里点菜时，在我心尖上感觉到的一种幸福", "type": 1, "chapterUid": 14}, {"bookId": "33642049", "bookmarkId": "33642049_13_7285-7536", "createTime": 1676114145, "range": "7285-7536", "markText": "“您当然不会去看这样的电影。但是您一定要去看这部电影，把小女士也带上。你们一定会喜欢的……艾克雷姆·居齐鲁在电影里扮演先知易卜拉欣。我是和老婆、丈母娘、孩子们一起去看的，我们都大哭了一场。当先知易卜拉欣拿起刀、看着儿子时我们哭了……当他的儿子伊斯玛义就像《古兰经》里写到的那样，说‘亲爱的爸爸，你就按照真主的旨意来做吧’时，我们也哭了……当代替儿子的羊出现时，我们和所有观众一起喜极而泣。如果我们把自己最珍贵的东西，不求回报地献给我们深爱的人，那样的话世界就会美好了。小女士，我们就是因为这个而哭的。”", "type": 1, "chapterUid": 13}], "removed": [], "chapters": [{"title": "19 葬礼", "chapterUid": 21, "chapterIdx": 21}, {"title": "17 我的整个人生和你的连在了一起", "chapterUid": 19, "chapterIdx": 19}, {"title": "61 看", "chapterUid": 63, "chapterIdx": 63}, {"title": "18 贝尔琪丝的故事", "chapterUid": 20, "chapterIdx": 20}, {"title": "12 接吻", "chapterUid": 14, "chapterIdx": 14}, {"title": "11 宰牲节", "chapterUid": 13, "chapterIdx": 13}], "book": {"bookId": "33642049", "version": 408200179, "format": "epub", "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/89/YueWen_33642049/s_YueWen_33642049.jpg", "title": "帕慕克别样的色彩系列：纯真博物馆", "author": "[土]奥尔罕·帕慕克", "coverBoxInfo": {"blurhash": "KGQ0X7M_of}lRPkCcZofRj", "colors": [{"key": "1/4", "hex": "#2b1900"}, {"key": "1/6", "hex": "#311700"}, {"key": "1/8", "hex": "#361500"}, {"key": "2/4", "hex": "#3f2e06"}, {"key": "2/6", "hex": "#442d00"}, {"key": "2/8", "hex": "#482c00"}, {"key": "3/4", "hex": "#57451e"}, {"key": "3/6", "hex": "#5c4400"}, {"key": "3/8", "hex": "#5f4300"}, {"key": "3/12", "hex": "#664100"}, {"key": "4/6", "hex": "#775d18"}, {"key": "4/10", "hex": "#7d5b00"}, {"key": "4/4", "hex": "#715e32"}, {"key": "5/10", "hex": "#9a7400"}, {"key": "5/4", "hex": "#8c774a"}, {"key": "5/8", "hex": "#97750a"}, {"key": "6/4", "hex": "#a59262"}, {"key": "6/6", "hex": "#ad9047"}, {"key": "6/8", "hex": "#b28f29"}, {"key": "6/12", "hex": "#b98e00"}, {"key": "7/8", "hex": "#cdaa45"}, {"key": "7/10", "hex": "#d2a91e"}, {"key": "7/12", "hex": "#d6a800"}, {"key": "8/4", "hex": "#dac793"}, {"key": "8/6", "hex": "#e2c679"}, {"key": "8/12", "hex": "#f2c300"}, {"key": "9/2", "hex": "#ede3c4"}, {"key": "9/12", "hex": "#ffde2e"}, {"key": "1/100", "hex": "#b28f29"}, {"key": "2/100", "hex": "#cdaa45"}, {"key": "3/100", "hex": "#ffffff"}, {"key": "4/100", "hex": "#F3F1E5"}, {"key": "5/100", "hex": "#F3F1E5"}, {"key": "6/100", "hex": "#271E00"}], "dominate_color": {"hex": "#efeadd", "hsv": [42.09754543887431, 7.464924751213295, 93.67392192427734]}, "custom_cover": "https://weread-1258476243.file.myqcloud.com/bookalphacover/49/33642049/s_33642049.jpg", "custom_rec_cover": "https://weread-1258476243.file.myqcloud.com/bookreccover/49/33642049/s_33642049.jpg", "colorsPure": ["#b98e00", "#d6a800"]}}}, "reviews": {"reviews": [{"reviewId": "17408780_7GMX49Ee2", "review": {"bookId": "33642049", "content": "帕慕克喜欢的作家们。", "bookVersion": 2090947549, "range": "1271-1998", "abstract": "想，当得知圣彼得堡陀思妥耶夫斯基博物馆里惟一一件真品，是一个藏在玻璃罩里、边上写着“确实是陀思妥耶夫斯基的”帽子时，他也许会笑的。对于在同一座城市里的纳博科夫博物馆，在斯大林时期被当地一个审查机构用作办公楼，他又会作何感想？我对他说，在伊利耶—贡布雷的马塞尔·普鲁斯特博物馆，我看见了一些用作家小说里的主人公为蓝本绘制的人物肖像，它们让我了解的不是小说本身，而是作家生活的那个世界。不，我不认为作家的博物馆荒唐。比如说，在荷兰莱因斯堡小镇的斯宾诺莎之家里，像在17世纪出版的那样，集中展出了作家去世后记录在案的所有书籍，我认为这很好。在泰戈尔博物馆，看着作家画的那些水彩画，想起早期阿塔图尔克博物馆里的灰尘和潮湿的味道，漫步在迷宫般的展厅里，听着加尔各答永不停息的噪音，我度过了多么幸福的一天！我还谈到了，在西西里的阿格里真托市里的皮兰德娄之家，我看到的那些感觉好像是属于我们家的照片；在斯德哥尔摩的斯特林堡博物馆，我透过窗户看到的城市风景；在巴尔的摩，埃德加·爱伦·坡和姨妈以及后来和他结婚的表妹弗吉尼亚居住的四层小楼，那栋窄小、忧伤的小楼，让我感觉似曾相识（在巴尔的摩的坡之家博物馆，这栋现今位于一个边远和贫穷街区里的四层小楼，因它的窄小、忧伤的样子，房间和形状，在我参观过的所有博物馆里，是一个最像凯斯金家的地方）。我还告诉奥尔罕先生，我见过的最完美的作家博物馆，是在罗马朱丽娅小街上的马里奥·普拉兹博物馆。浪漫主义的伟大历史学家马里奥·普拉兹，像文学一样喜欢绘画，像我这样预约走进博物馆的人，一定要看像小说那样一个个展厅、一件件物品讲述大作家藏品故事的书籍……在卢昂，福楼拜出生的家里放满了他父亲的医学书籍，因此根本没必要去福楼拜和医学史博物馆。", "type": 1, "chapterUid": 85, "reviewId": "17408780_7GMX49Ee2", "userVid": 17408780, "topics": [], "createTime": 1679069077, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "33642049", "format": "epub", "version": 408200179, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/89/YueWen_33642049/s_YueWen_33642049.jpg", "title": "帕慕克别样的色彩系列：纯真博物馆", "author": "[土]奥尔罕·帕慕克", "translator": "陈竹冰", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterIdx": 85, "chapterTitle": "83 幸福", "author": {"userVid": 17408780, "name": "钟涵", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/1OfJCYwoJtaLU1wLBu3bTrBODSyuW89Q3VtvETqKuY4TKP83GoRQwpFiaibK7yicKS9fSOicARg2zvEv2aicibgafxxgj1xibWicLjSLbicqiaaFm0H7M/132", "isFollowing": 1, "isFollower": 1, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M6-0-1000", "desc": "收到的赞", "title": "收到的赞", "levelIndex": 1000}}}}, {"reviewId": "17408780_7GMWr9CaI", "review": {"bookVersion": 2090947549, "bookId": "33642049", "content": "最真诚的小说，喜欢帕慕克这种细密画式的写作方式，让读者好像真的经历了一次拥有如此纯真爱情的人生，很精彩，很幸福。一定要去土耳其参观一下纯真博物馆。", "type": 4, "star": 100, "reviewId": "17408780_7GMWr9CaI", "userVid": 17408780, "topics": [], "createTime": 1679068500, "flag": 0, "newRatingLevel": 1, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "33642049", "format": "epub", "version": 408200179, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/89/YueWen_33642049/s_YueWen_33642049.jpg", "title": "帕慕克别样的色彩系列：纯真博物馆", "author": "[土]奥尔罕·帕慕克", "translator": "陈竹冰", "payType": 1048577}, "bookFinderSuccessCount": 0, "author": {"userVid": 17408780, "name": "钟涵", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/1OfJCYwoJtaLU1wLBu3bTrBODSyuW89Q3VtvETqKuY4TKP83GoRQwpFiaibK7yicKS9fSOicARg2zvEv2aicibgafxxgj1xibWicLjSLbicqiaaFm0H7M/132", "isFollowing": 1, "isFollower": 1, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M6-0-1000", "desc": "收到的赞", "title": "收到的赞", "levelIndex": 1000}}}, "likesCount": 1, "friendLikesCount": 1}, {"reviewId": "17408780_7GInhWGB0", "review": {"bookId": "33642049", "content": "难道康乃馨写的那则丑闻是受凯末尔母亲的指示吗？是因为老太太对于凯末尔当时的行径实在无法容忍了？", "bookVersion": 2090947549, "range": "9119-9183", "abstract": "我去告诉白色·康乃馨，他会在两个娱乐专栏上像一个浪漫的故事、一则人人都喜欢的传闻那样把这件事写出来的，过不了两天一切都会被忘记。", "type": 1, "chapterUid": 78, "reviewId": "17408780_7GInhWGB0", "userVid": 17408780, "topics": [], "createTime": 1678809099, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "33642049", "format": "epub", "version": 408200179, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/89/YueWen_33642049/s_YueWen_33642049.jpg", "title": "帕慕克别样的色彩系列：纯真博物馆", "author": "[土]奥尔罕·帕慕克", "translator": "陈竹冰", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterIdx": 78, "chapterTitle": "76 贝伊奥鲁的电影院", "author": {"userVid": 17408780, "name": "钟涵", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/1OfJCYwoJtaLU1wLBu3bTrBODSyuW89Q3VtvETqKuY4TKP83GoRQwpFiaibK7yicKS9fSOicARg2zvEv2aicibgafxxgj1xibWicLjSLbicqiaaFm0H7M/132", "isFollowing": 1, "isFollower": 1, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M6-0-1000", "desc": "收到的赞", "title": "收到的赞", "levelIndex": 1000}}}, "likesCount": 7}, {"reviewId": "17408780_7GGXj46Mr", "review": {"bookId": "33642049", "content": "这几句对话对于芙颂人物刻画至关重要，芙颂当然认真考虑过去找个金主，当电影明星，这对于她再容易不过，在他们一起去酒吧的那些夜晚，她可能有无数次机会。", "bookVersion": 2090947549, "range": "5112-5343", "abstract": "她接着说道：“但我敬佩她。就像电影里的那些美国人那样，她一旦拿定了主意就会去坚持，她成功了。我伤心并不是因为自己没能成为像帕帕特亚那样的电影演员，而是因为没能像她那样坚持，我怪我自己。”\n“九年来我一直在坚持，但不是只要坚持就可以成功的。”\n“可以的，”她冷静地回答道。“你已经和我母亲谈过，现在让我们来谈一谈。”", "type": 1, "chapterUid": 77, "reviewId": "17408780_7GGXj46Mr", "userVid": 17408780, "topics": [], "createTime": 1678728496, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "33642049", "format": "epub", "version": 408200179, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/89/YueWen_33642049/s_YueWen_33642049.jpg", "title": "帕慕克别样的色彩系列：纯真博物馆", "author": "[土]奥尔罕·帕慕克", "translator": "陈竹冰", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterIdx": 77, "chapterTitle": "75 珍珠蛋糕店", "author": {"userVid": 17408780, "name": "钟涵", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/1OfJCYwoJtaLU1wLBu3bTrBODSyuW89Q3VtvETqKuY4TKP83GoRQwpFiaibK7yicKS9fSOicARg2zvEv2aicibgafxxgj1xibWicLjSLbicqiaaFm0H7M/132", "isFollowing": 1, "isFollower": 1, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M6-0-1000", "desc": "收到的赞", "title": "收到的赞", "levelIndex": 1000}}}, "likesCount": 1}, {"reviewId": "17408780_7GEGLJ55m", "review": {"bookId": "33642049", "content": "古希腊哲学家才这么认为吧，比如亚里士多德。", "bookVersion": 2090947549, "range": "4459-4496", "abstract": "我说：“被丢弃在一边的东西会让我很伤心。中国人相信所有东西都是有灵魂的。”", "type": 1, "chapterUid": 67, "reviewId": "17408780_7GEGLJ55m", "userVid": 17408780, "topics": [], "createTime": 1678599745, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "33642049", "format": "epub", "version": 408200179, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/89/YueWen_33642049/s_YueWen_33642049.jpg", "title": "帕慕克别样的色彩系列：纯真博物馆", "author": "[土]奥尔罕·帕慕克", "translator": "陈竹冰", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterIdx": 67, "chapterTitle": "65 小狗摆设", "author": {"userVid": 17408780, "name": "钟涵", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/1OfJCYwoJtaLU1wLBu3bTrBODSyuW89Q3VtvETqKuY4TKP83GoRQwpFiaibK7yicKS9fSOicARg2zvEv2aicibgafxxgj1xibWicLjSLbicqiaaFm0H7M/132", "isFollowing": 1, "isFollower": 1, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M6-0-1000", "desc": "收到的赞", "title": "收到的赞", "levelIndex": 1000}}}}, {"reviewId": "17408780_7GuEJVUZK", "review": {"bookId": "33642049", "content": "坐坐这个词对于国人在熟悉不过了，“没事上家坐坐”。", "bookVersion": 2090947549, "range": "5812-5950", "abstract": "坐坐”这个词，就像土耳其读者很清楚，但外国参观者无法立刻明白的那样，尽管字典上未被强调，却具有广泛的含义，比如“来做客”，“顺路过来看看”，“一起打发时间”，这个词特别是内希贝姑妈会经常用。晚上离开时，内希贝姑妈总会客气地对我说：“凯末尔先生，明天您还过来，我们还一起坐坐。”", "type": 1, "chapterUid": 57, "reviewId": "17408780_7GuEJVUZK", "userVid": 17408780, "topics": [], "createTime": 1678029883, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "33642049", "format": "epub", "version": 408200179, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/89/YueWen_33642049/s_YueWen_33642049.jpg", "title": "帕慕克别样的色彩系列：纯真博物馆", "author": "[土]奥尔罕·帕慕克", "translator": "陈竹冰", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterIdx": 57, "chapterTitle": "55 明天您还过来，我们还一起坐坐", "author": {"userVid": 17408780, "name": "钟涵", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/1OfJCYwoJtaLU1wLBu3bTrBODSyuW89Q3VtvETqKuY4TKP83GoRQwpFiaibK7yicKS9fSOicARg2zvEv2aicibgafxxgj1xibWicLjSLbicqiaaFm0H7M/132", "isFollowing": 1, "isFollower": 1, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M6-0-1000", "desc": "收到的赞", "title": "收到的赞", "levelIndex": 1000}}}}, {"reviewId": "17408780_7Gum6JySY", "review": {"bookId": "33642049", "content": "帕慕克反复用“女婿”作为称呼，暗示这门婚姻是父母促成的，至少这是他所希望的。", "bookVersion": 2090947549, "range": "2227-2237", "abstract": "女婿先生真诚地笑着说", "type": 1, "chapterUid": 53, "reviewId": "17408780_7Gum6JySY", "userVid": 17408780, "topics": [], "createTime": 1678012814, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "33642049", "format": "epub", "version": 408200179, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/89/YueWen_33642049/s_YueWen_33642049.jpg", "title": "帕慕克别样的色彩系列：纯真博物馆", "author": "[土]奥尔罕·帕慕克", "translator": "陈竹冰", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterIdx": 53, "chapterTitle": "51 幸福仅仅就是靠近所爱的人", "author": {"userVid": 17408780, "name": "钟涵", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/1OfJCYwoJtaLU1wLBu3bTrBODSyuW89Q3VtvETqKuY4TKP83GoRQwpFiaibK7yicKS9fSOicARg2zvEv2aicibgafxxgj1xibWicLjSLbicqiaaFm0H7M/132", "isFollowing": 1, "isFollower": 1, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M6-0-1000", "desc": "收到的赞", "title": "收到的赞", "levelIndex": 1000}}}, "likesCount": 9}, {"reviewId": "17408780_7GufK1rys", "review": {"bookId": "33642049", "content": "我们管这个叫“断片儿”，无论从表面还是隐喻都是一个意思。", "bookVersion": 2090947549, "range": "8798-8888", "abstract": "带着这个惊喜的发现，我一定是在浴室里待了很久，因为大概有人在门口故意咳了几声，或者敲了门，我记不清了，因为“电影中断了”。年轻时，当我们因为喝醉忘记后来的事情时，我们都会用这个词。", "type": 1, "chapterUid": 51, "reviewId": "17408780_7GufK1rys", "userVid": 17408780, "topics": [], "createTime": 1678006981, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "33642049", "format": "epub", "version": 408200179, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/89/YueWen_33642049/s_YueWen_33642049.jpg", "title": "帕慕克别样的色彩系列：纯真博物馆", "author": "[土]奥尔罕·帕慕克", "translator": "陈竹冰", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterIdx": 51, "chapterTitle": "49 我是要向她求婚的", "author": {"userVid": 17408780, "name": "钟涵", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/1OfJCYwoJtaLU1wLBu3bTrBODSyuW89Q3VtvETqKuY4TKP83GoRQwpFiaibK7yicKS9fSOicARg2zvEv2aicibgafxxgj1xibWicLjSLbicqiaaFm0H7M/132", "isFollowing": 1, "isFollower": 1, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M6-0-1000", "desc": "收到的赞", "title": "收到的赞", "levelIndex": 1000}}}, "commentsCount": 1, "likesCount": 1, "friendLikesCount": 1}, {"reviewId": "17408780_7GsKvCOYe", "review": {"bookId": "33642049", "content": "这是不是有点过分了，一个半小时太久了。", "bookVersion": 2090947549, "range": "5079-5185", "abstract": "一走进单元房，我就去洗了脸，我像一个准备手术的医生那样，小心翼翼地脱下西服和衬衫，坐到了和芙颂做了四十四次爱的床边，我从周围那些充满了回忆的物件当中，拿出我在这里展出的三件物品，抚摸着它们度过了幸福的一个半小时。", "type": 1, "chapterUid": 44, "reviewId": "17408780_7GsKvCOYe", "userVid": 17408780, "topics": [], "createTime": 1677921568, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "33642049", "format": "epub", "version": 408200179, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/89/YueWen_33642049/s_YueWen_33642049.jpg", "title": "帕慕克别样的色彩系列：纯真博物馆", "author": "[土]奥尔罕·帕慕克", "translator": "陈竹冰", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterIdx": 44, "chapterTitle": "42 秋愁", "author": {"userVid": 17408780, "name": "钟涵", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/1OfJCYwoJtaLU1wLBu3bTrBODSyuW89Q3VtvETqKuY4TKP83GoRQwpFiaibK7yicKS9fSOicARg2zvEv2aicibgafxxgj1xibWicLjSLbicqiaaFm0H7M/132", "isFollowing": 1, "isFollower": 1, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M6-0-1000", "desc": "收到的赞", "title": "收到的赞", "levelIndex": 1000}}}}, {"reviewId": "17408780_7GssmwHCp", "review": {"bookId": "33642049", "content": "看来大家用的借口都差不多。", "bookVersion": 2090947549, "range": "2264-2355", "abstract": "哪个心软的男人能说“是”呢？我不情愿地说：“不是。你误解了。因为让一个女孩受到了伤害，也因为欺骗你，让我们的关系受到了玷污，让我感到了责任的压力，这让我疲惫，也带走了我生活的乐趣。”", "type": 1, "isPrivate": 1, "chapterUid": 41, "reviewId": "17408780_7GssmwHCp", "userVid": 17408780, "topics": [], "createTime": 1677904943, "flag": 8, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "33642049", "format": "epub", "version": 408200179, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/89/YueWen_33642049/s_YueWen_33642049.jpg", "title": "帕慕克别样的色彩系列：纯真博物馆", "author": "[土]奥尔罕·帕慕克", "translator": "陈竹冰", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterIdx": 41, "chapterTitle": "39 坦白", "author": {"userVid": 17408780, "name": "钟涵", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/1OfJCYwoJtaLU1wLBu3bTrBODSyuW89Q3VtvETqKuY4TKP83GoRQwpFiaibK7yicKS9fSOicARg2zvEv2aicibgafxxgj1xibWicLjSLbicqiaaFm0H7M/132", "isFollowing": 1, "isFollower": 1, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M6-0-1000", "desc": "收到的赞", "title": "收到的赞", "levelIndex": 1000}}}}, {"reviewId": "17408780_7GlB3alMb", "review": {"bookId": "33642049", "content": "唉，可怜的男人啊，将来的某个瞬间，你是会后悔的。", "bookVersion": 2090947549, "range": "1996-2097", "abstract": "她说“你怎么了？”她感到问题比流出的血更为严重。那时我多想拥抱她来忘记我的痛苦和痴迷，多想至少能够告诉她我的感受！然而我没对茜贝尔说上一两句好听的话，只是带着一种心跳的慌乱，昏昏沉沉、摇摇晃晃地上了车。", "type": 1, "isPrivate": 1, "chapterUid": 29, "reviewId": "17408780_7GlB3alMb", "userVid": 17408780, "topics": [], "createTime": 1677515301, "flag": 8, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "33642049", "format": "epub", "version": 408200179, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/89/YueWen_33642049/s_YueWen_33642049.jpg", "title": "帕慕克别样的色彩系列：纯真博物馆", "author": "[土]奥尔罕·帕慕克", "translator": "陈竹冰", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterIdx": 29, "chapterTitle": "27 别那么往后仰，你会掉下来的", "author": {"userVid": 17408780, "name": "钟涵", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/1OfJCYwoJtaLU1wLBu3bTrBODSyuW89Q3VtvETqKuY4TKP83GoRQwpFiaibK7yicKS9fSOicARg2zvEv2aicibgafxxgj1xibWicLjSLbicqiaaFm0H7M/132", "isFollowing": 1, "isFollower": 1, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M6-0-1000", "desc": "收到的赞", "title": "收到的赞", "levelIndex": 1000}}}}, {"reviewId": "17408780_7GjPXqMYG", "review": {"bookId": "33642049", "content": "当时，芙颂的心碎了！芙颂多次问过是否也会与西贝尔约会，因为性爱是芙颂唯一可以与西贝尔区分的，也是芙颂唯一的“秘密武器”，原来西贝尔也可以。", "bookVersion": 2090947549, "range": "1247-1268", "abstract": "因为我对她隐瞒了和茜贝尔在办公室约会的事情", "type": 1, "chapterUid": 28, "reviewId": "17408780_7GjPXqMYG", "userVid": 17408780, "topics": [], "createTime": 1677415358, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "33642049", "format": "epub", "version": 408200179, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/89/YueWen_33642049/s_YueWen_33642049.jpg", "title": "帕慕克别样的色彩系列：纯真博物馆", "author": "[土]奥尔罕·帕慕克", "translator": "陈竹冰", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterIdx": 28, "chapterTitle": "26 爱情之痛的解剖分布", "author": {"userVid": 17408780, "name": "钟涵", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/1OfJCYwoJtaLU1wLBu3bTrBODSyuW89Q3VtvETqKuY4TKP83GoRQwpFiaibK7yicKS9fSOicARg2zvEv2aicibgafxxgj1xibWicLjSLbicqiaaFm0H7M/132", "isFollowing": 1, "isFollower": 1, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M6-0-1000", "desc": "收到的赞", "title": "收到的赞", "levelIndex": 1000}}}, "likesCount": 5}, {"reviewId": "17408780_7GjPwIVBv", "review": {"bookId": "33642049", "content": "这段描述虽然逼真，太不现实，当面对如此大的焦虑与悲伤时，人最多记住一两个细节，大脑会保护自己从而强行遗忘。", "chapterUid": 27, "type": 1, "bookVersion": 2090947549, "reviewId": "17408780_7GjPwIVBv", "userVid": 17408780, "topics": [], "createTime": 1677414963, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "33642049", "format": "epub", "version": 408200179, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/89/YueWen_33642049/s_YueWen_33642049.jpg", "title": "帕慕克别样的色彩系列：纯真博物馆", "author": "[土]奥尔罕·帕慕克", "translator": "陈竹冰", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterIdx": 27, "chapterTitle": "25 等待的痛苦", "author": {"userVid": 17408780, "name": "钟涵", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/1OfJCYwoJtaLU1wLBu3bTrBODSyuW89Q3VtvETqKuY4TKP83GoRQwpFiaibK7yicKS9fSOicARg2zvEv2aicibgafxxgj1xibWicLjSLbicqiaaFm0H7M/132", "isFollowing": 1, "isFollower": 1, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M6-0-1000", "desc": "收到的赞", "title": "收到的赞", "levelIndex": 1000}}}, "likesCount": 1}, {"reviewId": "17408780_7GjJVrskV", "review": {"bookId": "33642049", "content": "大量细节描写时，帕慕克突然的失忆真是画龙点睛，一切更加真实了。", "bookVersion": 2090947549, "range": "29142-29197", "abstract": "哥哥说了些什么，多年后尽管我完全忘记了他说的那些话，但我记得，好像是一个非常重要的话题那样，我努力去加入谈话。", "type": 1, "chapterUid": 26, "reviewId": "17408780_7GjJVrskV", "userVid": 17408780, "topics": [], "createTime": 1677409832, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "33642049", "format": "epub", "version": 408200179, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/89/YueWen_33642049/s_YueWen_33642049.jpg", "title": "帕慕克别样的色彩系列：纯真博物馆", "author": "[土]奥尔罕·帕慕克", "translator": "陈竹冰", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterIdx": 26, "chapterTitle": "24 订婚", "author": {"userVid": 17408780, "name": "钟涵", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/1OfJCYwoJtaLU1wLBu3bTrBODSyuW89Q3VtvETqKuY4TKP83GoRQwpFiaibK7yicKS9fSOicARg2zvEv2aicibgafxxgj1xibWicLjSLbicqiaaFm0H7M/132", "isFollowing": 1, "isFollower": 1, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M6-0-1000", "desc": "收到的赞", "title": "收到的赞", "levelIndex": 1000}}}, "likesCount": 1}, {"reviewId": "17408780_7GjJVomS4", "review": {"bookId": "33642049", "content": "帕慕克是真挺有意思，把自己写到书里，并且真的造了一个纯真博物馆，让人不得不对小说内容信以为真。", "bookVersion": 2090947549, "range": "21422-21551", "abstract": "而第二个请芙颂跳舞的人，从他那骄傲的语气来看，正是我在帕慕克一家的桌子上刚才与之对视过的奥尔罕先生本人。本书的作者，二十五年后两眼放光地和我说起了那次跳舞的经历。读者若想知道奥尔罕先生和芙颂跳舞时的感受，请去看题为“幸福”的最后那一节，作者会亲口告诉你们的。", "type": 1, "chapterUid": 26, "reviewId": "17408780_7GjJVomS4", "userVid": 17408780, "topics": [], "createTime": 1677409831, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "33642049", "format": "epub", "version": 408200179, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/89/YueWen_33642049/s_YueWen_33642049.jpg", "title": "帕慕克别样的色彩系列：纯真博物馆", "author": "[土]奥尔罕·帕慕克", "translator": "陈竹冰", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterIdx": 26, "chapterTitle": "24 订婚", "author": {"userVid": 17408780, "name": "钟涵", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/1OfJCYwoJtaLU1wLBu3bTrBODSyuW89Q3VtvETqKuY4TKP83GoRQwpFiaibK7yicKS9fSOicARg2zvEv2aicibgafxxgj1xibWicLjSLbicqiaaFm0H7M/132", "isFollowing": 1, "isFollower": 1, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M6-0-1000", "desc": "收到的赞", "title": "收到的赞", "levelIndex": 1000}}}}, {"reviewId": "17408780_7GjJVpXta", "review": {"bookId": "33642049", "content": "所以喜欢去妓院用金钱解决问题。", "bookVersion": 2090947549, "range": "24494-24541", "abstract": "“我不认为麦赫麦特今晚可以从扎伊姆手上把努尔吉汗抢回来。他害怕在聚会、宴请上和别的男人竞争。”", "type": 1, "chapterUid": 26, "reviewId": "17408780_7GjJVpXta", "userVid": 17408780, "topics": [], "createTime": 1677409831, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "33642049", "format": "epub", "version": 408200179, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/89/YueWen_33642049/s_YueWen_33642049.jpg", "title": "帕慕克别样的色彩系列：纯真博物馆", "author": "[土]奥尔罕·帕慕克", "translator": "陈竹冰", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterIdx": 26, "chapterTitle": "24 订婚", "author": {"userVid": 17408780, "name": "钟涵", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/1OfJCYwoJtaLU1wLBu3bTrBODSyuW89Q3VtvETqKuY4TKP83GoRQwpFiaibK7yicKS9fSOicARg2zvEv2aicibgafxxgj1xibWicLjSLbicqiaaFm0H7M/132", "isFollowing": 1, "isFollower": 1, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M6-0-1000", "desc": "收到的赞", "title": "收到的赞", "levelIndex": 1000}}}, "likesCount": 2}, {"reviewId": "17408780_7GjJVlCts", "review": {"bookId": "33642049", "content": "芙颂可能是与母亲有过激烈的争吵，并在独自哭泣后做出了艰难的决定。", "bookVersion": 2090947549, "range": "14491-14552", "abstract": "当我看见她眼里的血丝和眼睛下面稚气的水肿，正要得出她离开我后晚上在家哭过的结论时，她的脸上出现了一种自信、坚决的贵妇表情。", "type": 1, "chapterUid": 26, "reviewId": "17408780_7GjJVlCts", "userVid": 17408780, "topics": [], "createTime": 1677409830, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "33642049", "format": "epub", "version": 408200179, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/89/YueWen_33642049/s_YueWen_33642049.jpg", "title": "帕慕克别样的色彩系列：纯真博物馆", "author": "[土]奥尔罕·帕慕克", "translator": "陈竹冰", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterIdx": 26, "chapterTitle": "24 订婚", "author": {"userVid": 17408780, "name": "钟涵", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/1OfJCYwoJtaLU1wLBu3bTrBODSyuW89Q3VtvETqKuY4TKP83GoRQwpFiaibK7yicKS9fSOicARg2zvEv2aicibgafxxgj1xibWicLjSLbicqiaaFm0H7M/132", "isFollowing": 1, "isFollower": 1, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M6-0-1000", "desc": "收到的赞", "title": "收到的赞", "levelIndex": 1000}}}, "likesCount": 6}, {"reviewId": "17408780_7GjJVjsf0", "review": {"bookId": "33642049", "content": "这简直就是像在说我。", "bookVersion": 2090947549, "range": "4217-4248", "abstract": "“你很帅，但把背挺起来。”茜比尔不知不觉中重复了母亲说过的话。", "type": 1, "isPrivate": 1, "chapterUid": 26, "reviewId": "17408780_7GjJVjsf0", "userVid": 17408780, "topics": [], "createTime": 1677409830, "flag": 8, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "33642049", "format": "epub", "version": 408200179, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/89/YueWen_33642049/s_YueWen_33642049.jpg", "title": "帕慕克别样的色彩系列：纯真博物馆", "author": "[土]奥尔罕·帕慕克", "translator": "陈竹冰", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterIdx": 26, "chapterTitle": "24 订婚", "author": {"userVid": 17408780, "name": "钟涵", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/1OfJCYwoJtaLU1wLBu3bTrBODSyuW89Q3VtvETqKuY4TKP83GoRQwpFiaibK7yicKS9fSOicARg2zvEv2aicibgafxxgj1xibWicLjSLbicqiaaFm0H7M/132", "isFollowing": 1, "isFollower": 1, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M6-0-1000", "desc": "收到的赞", "title": "收到的赞", "levelIndex": 1000}}}}, {"reviewId": "17408780_7GjJVgWFY", "review": {"bookId": "33642049", "content": "这里是我看过用声音表达情感最好的一段文字，前面铺垫了很多小孩踢球的声音，这里的无声暗合了这段感情的一种结束。", "bookVersion": 2090947549, "range": "2289-2422", "abstract": "有一阵，芙颂像一个倾听自己身体的病人那样躺在床上，她仿佛在凝望头顶上的一片愁云，我躺到她身边，和她一起仰望天花板。踢足球的孩子们也不出声了，我们只听到了球的声音。随后鸟儿们也停止了鸣叫，一阵深沉的静默开始了。我们听到从远处传来的一声轮船的汽笛声，随后是另外一艘船的。", "type": 1, "chapterUid": 25, "reviewId": "17408780_7GjJVgWFY", "userVid": 17408780, "topics": [], "createTime": 1677409829, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "33642049", "fo