": "M6-0-1000", "desc": "收到的赞", "title": "收到的赞", "levelIndex": 1000}}}, "likesCount": 11}, {"reviewId": "17408780_7G3imlofE", "review": {"bookId": "33642049", "content": "这让我想起了为数众多的欧洲经典小说中一幕幕房间里的谈话", "bookVersion": 2090947549, "range": "3058-3099", "abstract": "“也就是说，一个男人和一个女孩，就不能像欧洲人那样不做爱长时间待在一个房间里吗？”", "type": 1, "chapterUid": 22, "reviewId": "17408780_7G3imlofE", "userVid": 17408780, "topics": [], "createTime": 1676475774, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "33642049", "format": "epub", "version": 408200179, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/89/YueWen_33642049/s_YueWen_33642049.jpg", "title": "帕慕克别样的色彩系列：纯真博物馆", "author": "[土]奥尔罕·帕慕克", "translator": "陈竹冰", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterIdx": 22, "chapterTitle": "20 芙颂的两个条件", "author": {"userVid": 17408780, "name": "钟涵", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/1OfJCYwoJtaLU1wLBu3bTrBODSyuW89Q3VtvETqKuY4TKP83GoRQwpFiaibK7yicKS9fSOicARg2zvEv2aicibgafxxgj1xibWicLjSLbicqiaaFm0H7M/132", "isFollowing": 1, "isFollower": 1, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M6-0-1000", "desc": "收到的赞", "title": "收到的赞", "levelIndex": 1000}}}}, {"reviewId": "17408780_7FXdBr3Hg", "review": {"bookId": "33642049", "content": "哈哈哈哈哈哈哈，精辟非凡", "bookVersion": 2090947549, "range": "4743-4865", "abstract": "一个新近从美国回来开了诊所的“心理医生”，一认识就给了我他新印的名片，在一个中年女人的一再追问下，他对聚拢在自己周围的人群描述了爱情的定义：一个人尽管有别的机会，但拒绝这些机会只想不断地和同一个人做爱，那么这种让人感觉幸福的情感就叫做“爱情”。", "type": 1, "chapterUid": 20, "reviewId": "17408780_7FXdBr3Hg", "userVid": 17408780, "topics": [], "createTime": 1676130614, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "33642049", "format": "epub", "version": 408200179, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/89/YueWen_33642049/s_YueWen_33642049.jpg", "title": "帕慕克别样的色彩系列：纯真博物馆", "author": "[土]奥尔罕·帕慕克", "translator": "陈竹冰", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterIdx": 20, "chapterTitle": "18 贝尔琪丝的故事", "author": {"userVid": 17408780, "name": "钟涵", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/1OfJCYwoJtaLU1wLBu3bTrBODSyuW89Q3VtvETqKuY4TKP83GoRQwpFiaibK7yicKS9fSOicARg2zvEv2aicibgafxxgj1xibWicLjSLbicqiaaFm0H7M/132", "isFollowing": 1, "isFollower": 1, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M6-0-1000", "desc": "收到的赞", "title": "收到的赞", "levelIndex": 1000}}}}, {"reviewId": "17408780_7FWVYyK53", "review": {"bookId": "33642049", "content": "无论多么愚昧的思想内核，都可以编织出感人的故事，并驯服一批人。帕慕克在这里狠狠的讽刺了一下穆斯林，怪不得当时会在土耳其引起那么大的争议。", "bookVersion": 2090947549, "range": "7285-7536", "abstract": "“您当然不会去看这样的电影。但是您一定要去看这部电影，把小女士也带上。你们一定会喜欢的……艾克雷姆·居齐鲁在电影里扮演先知易卜拉欣。我是和老婆、丈母娘、孩子们一起去看的，我们都大哭了一场。当先知易卜拉欣拿起刀、看着儿子时我们哭了……当他的儿子伊斯玛义就像《古兰经》里写到的那样，说‘亲爱的爸爸，你就按照真主的旨意来做吧’时，我们也哭了……当代替儿子的羊出现时，我们和所有观众一起喜极而泣。如果我们把自己最珍贵的东西，不求回报地献给我们深爱的人，那样的话世界就会美好了。小女士，我们就是因为这个而哭的。”", "type": 1, "chapterUid": 13, "reviewId": "17408780_7FWVYyK53", "userVid": 17408780, "topics": [], "createTime": 1676114466, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "33642049", "format": "epub", "version": 408200179, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/89/YueWen_33642049/s_YueWen_33642049.jpg", "title": "帕慕克别样的色彩系列：纯真博物馆", "author": "[土]奥尔罕·帕慕克", "translator": "陈竹冰", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterIdx": 13, "chapterTitle": "11 宰牲节", "author": {"userVid": 17408780, "name": "钟涵", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/1OfJCYwoJtaLU1wLBu3bTrBODSyuW89Q3VtvETqKuY4TKP83GoRQwpFiaibK7yicKS9fSOicARg2zvEv2aicibgafxxgj1xibWicLjSLbicqiaaFm0H7M/132", "isFollowing": 1, "isFollower": 1, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": 